'''Foussballclub Differdange 03''' is a [[association football|football]] club based in [[Differdange]], Luxembourg. The club currently competes in [[Luxembourg National Division]], the highest division in Luxembourg. Founded in 2003, FDC03 played its home games in [[Stade Municipal de la Ville de Differdange]], along with [[Stade du Thillenberg]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Stade Municipal de la Ville de Differdange – StadiumDB.com |url=https://stadiumdb.com/stadiums/lux/stade_municipal_oberkorn |access-date=2025-04-25 |website=stadiumdb.com}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Stade du Thillenberg – StadiumDB.com |url=https://stadiumdb.com/stadiums/lux/stade_du_thillenberg |access-date=2025-04-25 |website=stadiumdb.com}}</ref>"}}
